+    "note": "Generic gradient plus eta times centered Hessian <= N eta^3/12800 gives static trapping; nearby minimizing set <=eta/2 or <=eta/4 for centered errors. Cumulative gradient variation for time dependence; typed coefficients and loop readouts. 24 exact checks, five budgets, four synthetic matrix fixtures. No retained nominal stability, unique shifted orbit, attraction or physical calibration.",
